COSP2, the CFMIP Observation Simulator Package version 2
(https://github.com/CFMIP/COSPv2.0, BSD 3-clause license, see the header
of each file). Commit in COSP2_VERSION.

Only the files needed by RegCM are here, flattened in one directory:
src/ and src/simulator/ (RTTOV as stubs), model-interface/, and from
subsample_and_optics_example/ the subcolumn generator (scops.F90,
mo_rng.F90) and the optics routines (cosp_optics.F90).

Local change: cosp_kinds.F90 sets wp = dp (double precision).

The model calls the ISCCP and MODIS simulators with icosp = 1
(Main/radlib/mod_rad_cosp.F90).
